msgctxt "96"
msgid "I hope Shiro's okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Yeah. I'll go see if I can find out what's wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Shiro's still not looking so good, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Yeah, about that. It sounds like some kids at school have\r\n"
"been bullying him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Taichi told me. Apparently he found bruises all over Shiro's\r\n"
"body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Keep this between us, though. I just thought I should let\r\n"
"you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "I guess bullies do tend to go after the quiet kids..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Nobody deserves that kind of treatment, quiet or not.\r\n"
"I'll get to the bottom of this, Haruka."
msgstr ""

